  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">During the spring and summer months the club sponsors monthly 30-target 3D shoots normally on the first Sunday of the month but occasionally on a later Sunday to avoid holiday weekends.  In 2025, we will have a couple of Saturday afternoon shoots and a couple of Saturday evening spotlight shoots.  All of these shoots are open to the public.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">All members get their Sunday shoots for free, non-members  pay $15.  </p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Most of our targets are Rinehart targets and all are in excellent condition.  Our 30-target 3D course, which is separate from the three members-only practice ranges, is a 3/4 mile long loop with varying terrain and many uphill and downhill shots as well as shots from four elevated platforms. </p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">See the calendar for all specific shoot dates.</p></div>


  








